  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby approved shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans with the approved plans which forms part of this notice. \r \rLocation Plan; Transport Impact Assessment; Planning statement; 25_1033_101 Rev A; 25_1033_107 Rev A; 25_1033_108 Rev A; 25_1033_109; 25_1033_110; 25_1033_111; 25_1033_112.\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning. \r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 11 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units. \r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "No independent cooking or laundry facilities shall be installed in any of the respective bedrooms, and the communal kitchen and dining room (ground floor) and shall be retained as such, in accordance with the approved plans, in perpetuity.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "Within 3 months of the date of this decision, the 12 long stay cycle parking spaces hereby approved shall be provided  in accordance with the approved details and thereafter maintained unless otherwise submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. \r\rReason: To ensure the provision of cycle parking in line with the Council's adopted standards.\r",
    "Within 3 months of the date of this decision, the refuse and recycling storage hereby approved shall be provided in accordance with the approved details and thereafter maintained unless otherwise submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\rReason: In the interests of amenity and the recycling of waste materials in support of the Boroughs waste reduction targets. \r"
  ],
